1
00:01:08,610 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:16,000
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:17,780
Chen Jihong is out.

4
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,950
Then Zhao Xiao has no one left

5
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:21,789
to take the blame for him.

6
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
And Wang Jia'an's sister, Wang Yue—

7
00:01:24,030 --> 00:01:25,220
[Tomb of My Sister, Wang Yue]

8
00:01:26,430 --> 00:01:28,880
her death is directly related
to Zhao Xiao.

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,200
Once we uncover the truth

10
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:33,330
behind that missing time
between Wang Yue and Zhao Xiao,

11
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:37,400
Zhao Xiao is a dead man.

12
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,280
Jia'an.

13
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,120
I'm sorry.

14
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,509
We failed again this time.

15
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:47,750
I know you are disappointed.

16
00:01:48,430 --> 00:01:49,960
So we only have one way left.

17
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:54,640
We get the public to focus
on Wang Yue's case again.

18
00:01:55,610 --> 00:01:57,150
Maybe we will get new witnesses

19
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:58,410
or physical evidence.

20
00:01:58,509 --> 00:01:59,229
So,

21
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:02,200
we need to know more

22
00:02:02,590 --> 00:02:05,190
about the details
surrounding Yue's suicide.

23
00:02:19,079 --> 00:02:20,180
What the hell?

24
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,480
It's not Xu Yijia.

25
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,000
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

26
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,430
Xiao!

27
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,579
I will always support you.

28
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:35,780
[To Zhao Xiao] [Wang Yue]

29
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:37,840
Wang Yue.

30
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:39,660
Thank you.

31
00:02:40,150 --> 00:02:42,340
Can I take a picture of you?

32
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,000
Okay.

33
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,329
Done.

34
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:47,380
Thank you, Xiao.

35
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:48,520
Bye.

36
00:03:05,130 --> 00:03:06,100
[Three months ago, actor Zhao Xiao
was disfigured in a car crash.]

37
00:03:06,130 --> 00:03:09,390
[He recently announced
his return to the screen.]

38
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:33,970
[Glamour Yingcheng, Welcome
Ancient Rhythm, Modern Beauty]

39
00:03:33,990 --> 00:03:36,180
[Yingcheng Arts and Culture Festival]

40
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,210
Xiao.

41
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:39,510
I'm Wang Yue.

42
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,240
Do you still remember me?

43
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,980
I just want to tell you

44
00:03:43,310 --> 00:03:44,640
that no matter what you look like,

45
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:49,470
[Zhao Xiao]

46
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:46,310
I will always support you.

47
00:03:52,940 --> 00:03:54,650
[Zhao Xiao]

48
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:54,050
I remember you.

49
00:03:54,470 --> 00:03:55,400
I always have.

50
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:59,970
[Zhao Xiao]

51
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:15,950
Xiao, you're here.

52
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:27,950
Are you okay?

53
00:04:29,170 --> 00:04:30,070
Xiao,

54
00:04:30,230 --> 00:04:31,740
I will always be with you.

55
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,120
Don't leave me, okay?

56
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,320
You are all I have left.

57
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,390
[First Affiliated Hospital
of Yingcheng Medical University]

58
00:04:54,409 --> 00:04:55,500
[Skin Matching Test Report
for Full-Face Skin Grafting]

59
00:04:57,460 --> 00:04:58,380
[First Affiliated Hospital
of Yingcheng Medical University]

60
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,240
[Skin Matching Test Report
for Full-Face Skin Grafting]

61
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,350
[Full-Face Skin Graft Matching Report]

62
00:05:07,290 --> 00:05:10,660
[III. Test Conclusion]

63
00:05:14,020 --> 00:05:14,510
[Matching Failed]

64
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:15,850
[Not eligible for full-face
skin graft procedure]

65
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:27,390
You haven't been answering your phone

66
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:29,050
or replying to WeChat lately.

67
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,760
What have you been up to?

68
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:32,159
Nothing.

69
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,310
I did reply.

70
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,330
Are you dating someone?

71
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,800
No way.

72
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,270
Look me in the eyes.

73
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,260
You've figured it out?

74
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,270
Of course I have.

75
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,310
Back in high school,

76
00:05:50,310 --> 00:05:52,190
you had a crush on a boy in your class.

77
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:53,560
Every morning you'd get ready early

78
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,159
and wait by the window.

79
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,480
The second you saw his figure,

80
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,810
you'd rush downstairs.

81
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:02,740
We're not even at that stage yet.

82
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:04,680
What is he like?

83
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:08,880
His identity is a bit special.

84
00:06:08,990 --> 00:06:10,380
I can't tell you right now.

85
00:06:10,380 --> 00:06:12,090
But he's really super nice.

86
00:06:12,190 --> 00:06:13,190
Don't worry.

87
00:06:13,270 --> 00:06:14,660
So mysterious?

88
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:17,530
Let me check him out for you someday.

89
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:20,030
We'll talk about it then.

90
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,480
I'm heading back to school.

91
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,600
Don't bother walking me.

92
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,040
Okay.

93
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,430
-Bye.
-Bye.

94
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:27,070
Yue.

95
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:28,680
If you're dating someone,

96
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,720
take your time to get to know him first.

97
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:33,210
Not everyone is as innocent as you.

98
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,940
Okay.

99
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,520
Mom and Dad left us early.

100
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,480
If anything comes up, talk to me first.

101
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,740
Don't always make decisions on your own.

102
00:06:41,050 --> 00:06:42,080
-Bye.
-Bye.

103
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,310
Hello, Xiao.

104
00:06:57,090 --> 00:06:58,690
Why haven't you shown up yet?

105
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,300
You're waiting for me?

106
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,370
What for?

107
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,440
I won't meet you.

108
00:07:03,870 --> 00:07:05,360
I have nothing to do with you.

109
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,690
Don't contact me again.

110
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,840
Xiao... Xiao.

111
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,870
At that time, I thought

112
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,929
I might as well trade my life for his

113
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:40,669
and just stab that bastard Zhao Xiao
to death.

114
00:08:57,850 --> 00:08:59,580
When I saw the baby in her belly,

115
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,490
I immediately lost my courage.

116
00:09:03,910 --> 00:09:05,190
But looking back now,

117
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,240
I'm quite grateful to that girl.

118
00:09:09,930 --> 00:09:11,550
Yue wouldn't have wanted me

119
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,120
to give my own life

120
00:09:14,410 --> 00:09:16,390
for that bastard Zhao Xiao.

121
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:32,330
[Tomb of My Sister, Wang Yue]

122
00:09:45,870 --> 00:09:47,720
I followed him for a while,

123
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,120
until I saw the news

124
00:09:50,950 --> 00:09:52,440
of his comeback.

125
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:02,360
Actor Zhao Xiao has publicly announced
his comeback.

126
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:04,320
He had previously faded
from the entertainment industry

127
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,820
after facial disfigurement
in a car accident.

128
00:10:05,820 --> 00:10:08,480
For this return,
he plans to reinvent his image.

129
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:13,200
Zhao Xiao changed his face.

130
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,700
That's what Yue died for.

131
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:17,390
So,

132
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,560
there must be another girl he's fooled.

133
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,790
That bastard Zhao Xiao—

134
00:10:23,910 --> 00:10:26,370
he'll never stop
until he gets what he wants.

135
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:32,010
Hello, I'd like to ask,

136
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,080
has your hospital

137
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,320
ever admitted a patient named Zhao Xiao?

138
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,030
Sorry,

139
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:37,150
are you looking for someone?

140
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:38,630
No, I just want to ask

141
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,510
if there was anyone with Zhao Xiao,

142
00:10:40,510 --> 00:10:42,610
you know, the TV star.

143
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,910
Was there a girl

144
00:10:43,910 --> 00:10:45,440
who had surgery with him?

145
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:46,900
I'm sorry, ma'am.

146
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,440
Hospital policy

147
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:50,360
prevents us from disclosing
patient information.

148
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,280
I'm sorry.

149
00:10:53,650 --> 00:10:55,080
I searched the whole hospital

150
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,680
but couldn't find that girl.

151
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,510
Although I knew

152
00:10:59,150 --> 00:11:02,150
that even if I found her,
it would probably be too late.

153
00:11:02,590 --> 00:11:04,290
I was really afraid

154
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:07,620
that once she found out
Zhao Xiao was a liar,

155
00:11:08,620 --> 00:11:09,960
she'd end up like Yue.

156
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:13,580
Finally,

157
00:11:13,850 --> 00:11:15,560
I got my chance.

158
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,580
Lin Di'er was hiring a bodyguard,

159
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,830
so I applied.

160
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,330
On one hand,

161
00:11:24,070 --> 00:11:26,070
I figured being so close to Zhao Xiao

162
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:28,380
would give me a way to find evidence.

163
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:30,900
On the other hand,

164
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:34,510
I hoped to see that girl again.

165
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:37,040
I just didn't expect

166
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,460
that Zhao Xiao had covered

167
00:11:41,530 --> 00:11:43,500
everything up so cleanly.

168
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,500
When I found you following Zhao Xiao,

169
00:11:49,030 --> 00:11:50,970
I didn't know you were that girl.

170
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,440
But I was sure

171
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,030
that Zhao Xiao

172
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,810
must have done something terrible to you.

173
00:11:57,990 --> 00:11:59,670
You're not an ordinary paparazzo.

174
00:11:59,670 --> 00:12:00,840
There's hatred

175
00:12:01,670 --> 00:12:02,480
in your eyes.

176
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:04,030
I wanted to help you,

177
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,150
and help myself too.

178
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:09,470
I can't face my parents in the afterlife

179
00:12:09,610 --> 00:12:11,210
if I don't avenge Yue.

180
00:12:17,550 --> 00:12:18,600
Jia'an.

181
00:12:19,510 --> 00:12:21,570
Zhao Xiao will pay for what he's done.

182
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,630
Definitely.

183
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:24,960
But now,

184
00:12:26,030 --> 00:12:28,230
you have no leverage to get close to him.

185
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,450
As long as he is still in this industry,

186
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,840
I do.
